1
00:00:01,921 --> 00:00:03,298
Hoo, hoo!

2
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,337
Hi!

3
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:06,415
It's me, Popcorn!

4
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:11,767
Welcome to Popcorn Tales, the
cozy nest of bedtime stories.

5
00:00:12,079 --> 00:00:15,489
Hug your teddy, because
tonight's story is:

6
00:00:15,539 --> 00:00:18,126
The Cloud Who Couldn't Fall Asleep!

7
00:00:22,729 --> 00:00:28,096
Once upon a time, high up in the sky,
there was a little white cloud named

8
00:00:28,146 --> 00:00:29,346
Cotton.

9
00:00:29,874 --> 00:00:34,833
Cotton was fluffy like a bit of cotton
candy, and she loved to float very

10
00:00:34,883 --> 00:00:37,478
slowly through the colors of the evening.

11
00:00:38,128 --> 00:00:43,592
But that night, no matter how hard she
tried, the little cloud just couldn't

12
00:00:43,642 --> 00:00:45,236
close her eyes at all.

13
00:00:45,875 --> 00:00:51,561
She rolled to one side, then to the
other, and the sky grew darker and quieter

14
00:00:51,611 --> 00:00:52,928
all around her.

15
00:00:53,575 --> 00:00:55,389
Why can't I fall asleep tonight?

16
00:00:55,439 --> 00:01:01,242
Cotton asked, with a long, long
yawn, still unable to rest.

17
00:01:02,336 --> 00:01:06,833
Then Popcorn the little owl flew
by with her soft little wings,

18
00:01:06,892 --> 00:01:10,542
and she saw the little cloud
wiggling without stopping.

19
00:01:11,145 --> 00:01:12,521
Hoo, hoo!

20
00:01:12,627 --> 00:01:14,668
Hello, little cloud!

21
00:01:14,785 --> 00:01:17,999
You look very wide awake
for this time of night,

22
00:01:18,049 --> 00:01:21,671
Popcorn said, landing right beside Cotton.

23
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:27,533
I'm Cotton, and I want so much to sleep,
but my body just won't stay still,

24
00:01:27,583 --> 00:01:31,385
the little cloud answered
in a very quiet voice.

25
00:01:32,019 --> 00:01:36,586
Popcorn straightened her little
red bow and thought kindly.

26
00:01:37,177 --> 00:01:38,553
Hoo, hoo!

27
00:01:38,646 --> 00:01:43,359
Then let's go together and ask our
night-sky friends for a little help,

28
00:01:43,409 --> 00:01:48,143
the little owl suggested,
flapping her wings very gently.

29
00:01:48,791 --> 00:01:53,796
Cotton gave a shy little smile, and
the two of them began to float together

30
00:01:53,846 --> 00:01:55,330
through the dark sky.

31
00:01:56,450 --> 00:02:01,400
The first friend they met was
the Moon, big, round and golden,

32
00:02:01,450 --> 00:02:03,988
shining with a very soft light.

33
00:02:04,567 --> 00:02:06,764
Good evening, dear Moon!

34
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,058
Cotton can't fall asleep.

35
00:02:09,193 --> 00:02:11,404
Do you have a gentle tip for her?

36
00:02:11,454 --> 00:02:15,049
Popcorn asked, giving a
little bow with her wing.

37
00:02:15,696 --> 00:02:20,873
The Moon blinked very slowly, as
if she were sharing an old secret.

38
00:02:21,466 --> 00:02:23,967
Of course I do, my dears.

39
00:02:24,059 --> 00:02:28,664
I like to breathe in deeply, very
slowly, as if the air were a warm soft

40
00:02:28,714 --> 00:02:29,539
blanket,

41
00:02:29,589 --> 00:02:33,545
the Moon answered in a
gentle, glowing voice.

42
00:02:34,192 --> 00:02:38,412
So I need to fill my tummy with
air and let it out very softly?

43
00:02:38,462 --> 00:02:40,862
Cotton asked, listening carefully.

44
00:02:41,492 --> 00:02:43,355
That's right, little one.

45
00:02:43,484 --> 00:02:47,460
Three long breaths, and the body
already starts to feel lighter,

46
00:02:47,510 --> 00:02:51,298
the Moon explained, smiling
with her golden glow.

47
00:02:51,967 --> 00:02:57,256
Cotton thanked her with a little smile,
and Popcorn clapped her wings softly.

48
00:02:58,609 --> 00:03:03,337
After the Moon, the Wind
arrived, blowing very gently,

49
00:03:03,387 --> 00:03:06,412
like a friend who doesn't
want to wake anyone up.

50
00:03:07,010 --> 00:03:08,387
Hoo, hoo!

51
00:03:08,488 --> 00:03:12,857
Mister Wind, our friend Cotton
needs a tip to fall asleep,

52
00:03:12,907 --> 00:03:16,321
Popcorn said, holding on to her feathers.

53
00:03:16,946 --> 00:03:22,305
The Wind took a soft little turn around
them and spoke in a very mild voice.

54
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:28,128
I like to float very slowly, with no
hurry at all, as if the sky were a soft,

55
00:03:28,178 --> 00:03:29,368
cozy hammock,

56
00:03:29,418 --> 00:03:33,485
the Wind said, rocking the
tips of the cloud with care.

57
00:03:34,113 --> 00:03:35,510
With no hurry at all...

58
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,484
that sounds so lovely,

59
00:03:37,534 --> 00:03:41,837
Cotton murmured, letting her
little body grow a bit softer.

60
00:03:42,476 --> 00:03:46,151
When we slow down, sleep
often arrives all by itself,

61
00:03:46,201 --> 00:03:47,281
very quietly,

62
00:03:47,331 --> 00:03:52,522
the Wind added, drifting past them
gently and continuing on his way.

63
00:03:56,647 --> 00:04:02,125
A little farther on, a group of tiny
bright stars came twinkling right beside

64
00:04:02,175 --> 00:04:03,375
them.

65
00:04:03,515 --> 00:04:05,738
Hello, little stars!

66
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:09,636
Do you know any special way
to help Cotton fall asleep?

67
00:04:09,686 --> 00:04:13,780
Popcorn asked, her eyes
wide with curiosity.

68
00:04:14,427 --> 00:04:19,563
The little stars blinked together,
like a choir of tiny lights.

69
00:04:20,139 --> 00:04:23,586
We like to count the little
lights in the sky, very softly,

70
00:04:23,636 --> 00:04:26,205
one by one, with no hurry at all,

71
00:04:26,255 --> 00:04:30,030
said the brightest little
star in a sweet voice.

72
00:04:30,675 --> 00:04:32,246
Counting the little lights...

73
00:04:32,477 --> 00:04:33,870
what a calm idea!

74
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:38,709
Cotton said, already feeling
her heart beat a little slower.

75
00:04:39,289 --> 00:04:43,122
You can start with the ones
closest to you, and go far away,

76
00:04:43,172 --> 00:04:44,742
until sleep arrives,

77
00:04:44,792 --> 00:04:48,761
another little star
explained, glowing softly.

78
00:04:49,422 --> 00:04:53,252
Popcorn gave a proud little
smile at her cloud friend,

79
00:04:53,338 --> 00:04:55,683
who was listening so carefully.

80
00:04:56,803 --> 00:05:02,308
So Cotton decided to try every tip, one
at a time, right in the middle of the

81
00:05:02,358 --> 00:05:03,558
night sky.

82
00:05:04,255 --> 00:05:09,663
First, she filled her tummy with air
very slowly, and let it out like a warm

83
00:05:09,713 --> 00:05:12,724
soft sigh, three times in a row.

84
00:05:13,374 --> 00:05:18,518
Then she let her little body float
very softly, without rushing anywhere,

85
00:05:18,568 --> 00:05:20,788
just as the Wind had taught her.

86
00:05:21,415 --> 00:05:24,811
At last she began to
count the little lights:

87
00:05:24,861 --> 00:05:30,914
one tiny star, then another, then
one more, far away in the dark.

88
00:05:31,580 --> 00:05:32,915
One... two... three...

89
00:05:32,988 --> 00:05:35,245
the little lights are so quiet tonight,

90
00:05:35,295 --> 00:05:39,903
Cotton whispered, her voice
growing softer and softer.

91
00:05:40,497 --> 00:05:41,874
Hoo, hoo!

92
00:05:41,982 --> 00:05:44,700
You're doing so well, little one.

93
00:05:44,827 --> 00:05:46,818
It's okay to slow down,

94
00:05:46,868 --> 00:05:51,268
Popcorn said, right beside
the cloud's little ear.

95
00:05:51,869 --> 00:05:56,416
Cotton already felt her eyelids growing
heavy, but a little piece of sleep

96
00:05:56,466 --> 00:05:58,727
still had to arrive for good.

97
00:06:00,087 --> 00:06:05,162
Then a very fine little rain
began to fall, soft and fresh,

98
00:06:05,212 --> 00:06:07,389
like a lullaby made of water.

99
00:06:10,041 --> 00:06:14,866
The little droplets touched the
cloud very gently, one after another,

100
00:06:14,916 --> 00:06:18,108
and rocked Cotton like
a soft little swing.

101
00:06:18,753 --> 00:06:21,482
This little rain feels so lovely...

102
00:06:21,648 --> 00:06:25,133
it feels like a cozy bedtime
corner up here in the sky,

103
00:06:25,183 --> 00:06:28,777
Cotton murmured, almost asleep already.

104
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:33,489
Popcorn stayed very quiet
beside her, just watching,

105
00:06:33,547 --> 00:06:36,614
so she wouldn't interrupt
the sleep that was arriving.

106
00:06:37,268 --> 00:06:41,863
The little rain kept falling
softly, and Cotton closed her eyes,

107
00:06:41,935 --> 00:06:45,252
very slowly, with no hurry at all.

108
00:06:45,884 --> 00:06:51,057
The fluffy little cloud body grew round
and still, rocking to the rhythm of

109
00:06:51,107 --> 00:06:52,395
the droplets.

110
00:06:53,485 --> 00:06:58,602
And so, in the middle of the night
sky, little cloud Cotton finally fell

111
00:06:58,652 --> 00:07:02,635
asleep, all soft and
round with good sleep.

112
00:07:03,282 --> 00:07:08,496
The Moon smiled from above, the Wind
drifted by very gently so he wouldn't

113
00:07:08,546 --> 00:07:13,780
wake her, and the little stars glowed
more softly, like a night light.

114
00:07:14,377 --> 00:07:18,605
Hoo, hoo... calming your
body and mind is a gift.

115
00:07:18,914 --> 00:07:21,840
It's okay to slow down, little one,

116
00:07:21,890 --> 00:07:26,387
Popcorn whispered very softly,
near the sleeping cloud.

117
00:07:27,018 --> 00:07:31,598
The little owl straightened her
red bow and kept watch in the sky,

118
00:07:31,726 --> 00:07:33,793
looking after her friend's sleep.

119
00:07:34,441 --> 00:07:40,938
And down below, on the quiet earth,
the crickets sang a very gentle song.

120
00:07:48,241 --> 00:07:49,441
The End.

121
00:07:51,148 --> 00:07:51,860
Hoo...

122
00:07:51,910 --> 00:07:52,935
Psst!

123
00:07:52,985 --> 00:07:54,557
Are you still awake?

124
00:07:54,711 --> 00:07:56,764
Did you like tonight's story?

125
00:07:56,892 --> 00:08:01,790
Cotton and Popcorn showed us that
calming your body and mind is a gift,

126
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:04,427
and that it is okay to slow down.

127
00:08:04,675 --> 00:08:08,981
Good night, sleep tight, and
have the sweetest dreams.

128
00:08:09,277 --> 00:08:14,175
Grown-ups: if you enjoyed it,
please subscribe to Popcorn Tales,

129
00:08:14,225 --> 00:08:16,630
for more stories at bedtime.

130
00:08:16,934 --> 00:08:18,134
Hoo...

